154 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Today, handling documents for both individuals and businesses should be done effectively in this digital age. The project aims to provide an easy-to-use desktop application written in C# and SQL that will have the ability to scan physical documents and automatically recognize text through OCR and organize these documents in a structured and searchable format. This is to ensure that document management can be as straightforward and efficient as possible, where users can group their documents into categories, tag them, and access them without much hassle.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [3]
>>
